      "per_unit_reason": "Every literal instruction is study advice. Its24-exercise/eight-topic/three-level count was checked against all24 actual opt-ex inventory records, with each of the eight topic stems having exactly suffix1/2/3. No exercise body or hint is approved by this description."
    },
    {
      "key": "primer-optimization.html::node-89",
      "source": "SafeLearning/primer-optimization.html",
      "locator": "::node-89",
      "line": 84,
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "source_text": "Practice menu: Gradients, chain rules and Taylor models, Matrix derivatives and sensitivity, Lipschitz bounds, grids and model errors, Convexity, subgradients and conjugates, Steps, curvature and line searches, Feasibility, KKT and penalty residuals, Linear programs, quadratic programs and feasibility, Optimisers, worst cases and saddle points.",
      "text_sha256": "f6d9d3d4d1b717bf45048854e99ee57b9417baa9a43761947ef3dbd8dbaedbdc",
      "source_sha256": "74a2b1cef3b6dbe252f28084a00e848a18befb538d48e08bd76782d1511a6f1b",
